
# The newsletter sign-up. With NEWSLETTER_ACTION unset the form degrades to a
# mailto: link, which works but asks the reader to open a mail client - so set
# these as soon as a provider is chosen, or nobody subscribes.
#
#   NEWSLETTER_ACTION   the provider's form POST URL, copied from its embed
#                       snippet
#   NEWSLETTER_FIELD    the field name that provider expects. Buttondown and
#                       Beehiiv want "email", Mailchimp "EMAIL", Kit and
#                       EmailOctopus "email_address". Defaults to "email"
#   NEWSLETTER_PROVIDER a display name, used in the privacy note on /terms
#
# A production build logs a warning when NEWSLETTER_ACTION is unset, so this
# cannot quietly stay in mailto mode again.
#
# Set them in the Vercel project settings, not here - this file is committed.
# The list runs on Buttondown; its embed URL ends in the list's own name:
#
#   NEWSLETTER_ACTION=https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/<list>
#   NEWSLETTER_FIELD=email
#   NEWSLETTER_PROVIDER=Buttondown
NEWSLETTER_ACTION=
NEWSLETTER_FIELD=email
NEWSLETTER_PROVIDER=
